<title>USA: AST Research retains Morgan Stanley.</title>
<headline>AST Research retains Morgan Stanley.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>AST Research Inc said its special committee engaged Morgan Stanley and Co as its financial advisor.</p>
<p>As previously announced, AST formed a special committee  of three independent directors to evaluate the proposal made by Samsung Electronics Co Ltd to acquire all AST stock not owned by Samsung or its affiliates at a price of $5.10 per share. The committee is also considering other options that may be available to AST.</p>
</text>
